        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend The Cubes at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend The Cubes is a unique tower defense game that replaces static towers with deployable units that fight to protect your cube. Each wave of enemies brings new challenges, pushing you to think carefully about where and when to place your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enemies circling the cube along dynamic paths, no two battles ever feel the same. It’s all about planning, adapting, and outsmarting your foes before they can break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Unit Deployment</strong> – Position and manage units to counter ever-changing enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pathing</strong> – Enemies move along shifting paths around the cube, keeping battles unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible but Deep</strong> – Easy to learn, yet packed with strategic depth for tower defense fans.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend The Cubes at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend The Cubes is a unique tower defense game that replaces static towers with deployable units that fight to protect your cube. Each wave of enemies brings new challenges, pushing you to think carefully about where and when to place your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enemies circling the cube along dynamic paths, no two battles ever feel the same. It’s all about planning, adapting, and outsmarting your foes before they can break through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Unit Deployment</strong> – Position and manage units to counter ever-changing enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pathing</strong> – Enemies move along shifting paths around the cube, keeping battles unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible but Deep</strong> – Easy to learn, yet packed with strategic depth for tower defense fans.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Defend The Cubes is a strategic tower defense game where you deploy units instead of towers to protect your cube from challenging waves of enemies.",
